{"title":"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average (mean) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers, so the arithmetic mean or average must be the sum of the numbers divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>First, the sum of the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/d/13d8fb098942ddde19665e4cf3aa4c09487b87fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 5 + 6 + 8 + x = 8 + 14 + x = 22 + x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"319\" height=\"15\" />. The average is then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/8/d48ca0960a38d6ad1cdb840afe5b25dbaf42cdd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{22 + x}{5} = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0ba515d834d17fb71b73399a896678b072e485de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 22 = 7 \\times 5 = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/7/00786b906c703d68f48608e300997dded0cbd3b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 35 - 22 = \\boxed{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"149\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC\">2016 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_1\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 1\">Team Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Team Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3\">Individual 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 4\">Individual 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_5\" title=\"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 5\">Individual 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CE